            <note corresp="#d100-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d100-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Central Intelligence Agency, Job 79-01025A, Box 1, Folder 6. Secret;
                    Routine; RYBAT; PBSUCCESS. Repeated to Guatemala City.</p>
            </note>
